## Interface: 120100
## Title: XayaUI Debug
## Notes: XayaUI's debug tools: the console window (/xui console), the bug report (/xui bug), the debug report (/xui report), and XayaUI Rules' engine perf report (/xui debug perf), /xui status, /xui auras and /xuiengine. XayaUI loads them once per login or /reload, only while Settings > Debugging > Advanced Debugging is on (off by default), so they cost nothing otherwise. Also the run logger (Settings > Debugging > Advanced debug logging), which loads alone at a loading screen into a dungeon, key or raid.
## Author: Xaya
## Version: 0.7.2
## X-Date: 2026-11-19
## Dependencies: XayaUI
## OptionalDeps: XayaUI_Rules
## SavedVariables: XayaUIRunLogDB
## LoadOnDemand: 1
## Group: XayaUI

Tools.lua
Console.lua
BugReport.lua
DebugReport.lua
# XayaUI Rules' debug pieces (the engine perf report, /xui auras, /xuiengine, /xui status) are appended below this line. Each registers
# through Modules.lua (ns.RegisterDebugCommand, ns.RegisterCommand) and reads XayaUI Rules only through what it publishes; XayaUI Rules
# loads first when it is on (## OptionalDeps above). Tools.lua says how core gates them.
RulesPerf.lua
RulesStatus.lua
RulesAuras.lua
RulesEngine.lua
# (round 11b, SD-121..SD-128, SD-149) the run logger: Settings > Debugging > Advanced debug logging. It works while Advanced Debugging is off:
# then core loads this folder for the logger alone and every file above returns at its first line (XayaUI/DebugRecord.lua ns.DebugToolsWanted).
# Its saved data is XayaUIRunLogDB (SavedVariables\XayaUI_Debug.lua): counts only, never names or chat.
RunLogger.lua
